guide forever/professions/tailoring
title Tailoring 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Data:
# The Forever client's tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents, vendor
# prices) via wago.tools, with Classic Era filling the few spells and items
# they lack; pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated trainer list
# checked against npcs.json. Forever changed many thresholds, reagents and
# names from Classic, so Classic recipe tables do not apply.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-50  Simple Linen Pants (about 53)
#    50-75  Linen Belt (about 43)
#    75-80  Linen Belt (about 23)
#    80-110 Woolen Cape (about 66)
#   110-125 Double-stitched Woolen Shoulders (about 20)
#   125-150 Gloves of Meditation (about 52)
#   150-180 Azure Silk Cloak (about 42)
#   180-185 Crimson Silk Pantaloons (about 6)
#   185-205 Black Mageweave Vest (about 32)
#   205-225 Black Mageweave Headband (about 32)
#   225-236 Runecloth Belt (about 14)
#   236-251 Runecloth Gloves (about 16)
#   251-295 Runecloth Cuffs (about 134)
#   295-300 not routed: no trainer or vendor recipe gives points there

step Apprentice Tailoring
  tip Tailoring runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 8s in all.
  train Tailoring Apprentice
  skill Tailoring 1
  buy 2320 x96 nearest

step Linen Cloth
  tip Kill the mobs that drop it at the farm spot Polestar picks for your level and faction. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2589 x192 nearest

step Simple Linen Pants to 50
  tip Orange (a point every craft) until 40, yellow until 50, green until 60.
  craft 2963 x53
  craft 12044 until 50

step Tailoring recipes at 50
  tip Back to a Tailoring trainer: Linen Belt is taught from Tailoring 50.
  learn 8776

step Linen Belt to 75
  tip Yellow until 67, green until 85: not every craft gives a point. 75 is the Apprentice cap.
  craft 2963 x43
  craft 8776 until 75
