step Tailoring 295-300
  tip On Forever no recipe a trainer teaches or both factions' vendors sell gives Tailoring points past 295, so Polestar has no route for the last points. Recipes that still do: Mooncloth (needs a Moonwell), Mooncloth Leggings (needs a Spinning Wheel), Mooncloth Bag (recipe is a drop), Wizardweave Robe (recipe is a drop), Wisdom of the Timbermaw (needs a Spinning Wheel).
  skill Tailoring 300
